 "description": "BIGVILLE R17 (block 265000) -- af_choose_action (THE HEADLINE): the chosen action is the decision_value Argmax over the Action menu (same Argmax family as nd_choose_good / ss_choose_burn). decision_value = base_value + affect_gain * eff_distress * grief_affinity, eff_distress = grief_distress * clamp01(1-regulation). work has high base + NEGATIVE grief affinity (grief makes work unreachable); withdraw/drink(self-medicate)/snap(lowered snap threshold -> R15 violence) have increasing positive affinities, so grief SHIFTS the Argmax from work toward withdrawal->drink->snap. affect_gain is the COUPLING KNOB and the FALSIFIER: affect_gain=0 removes grief from decision_value -> base_value only -> identical under grief and contentment = the proven DIORAMA. The affect is FELT only because it is a TERM in the selector. Composes existing Terms only; ZERO new Rust.",
